=== §3 FACTORIZATION by symmetry sector (carved) ===
  ANTISYM Inv(W(x)G) = Inv(W)^anti (x) Inv(G)^sym  (+)  Inv(W)^sym (x) Inv(G)^anti
                     = 1 (x) 1  (+)  0 (x) {0 or 1}  =  1   forall g  (= omega (x) eta').
  => Lambda^2 cocycle FORCED forall k,g (unique antisym invariant).
  g=2 exception lives ONLY in the SYM sector: omega (x) eps_G (SYMMETRIC, NOT a Lie cocycle),
  since Inv(W)^sym = 0 kills any antisym contribution from the extra area form.

